  "description": "Drowning in debt, Choi Ihyun finally gets the chance to chase his dream of becoming an actor. While celebrating a small supporting role with a friend, he accidentally witnesses top star Baek Sungwoo engaged in a forceful outdoor tryst.\n\n*That actor… was really like that?*\n\nBefore Ihyun can slip away unnoticed, their eyes meet.\nNow, it seems Sungwoo has taken a troubling interest in him…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/reuinion_trap), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/fake_trap)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.boomtoon.com/detail/fake_trap), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/fake_trap)",
